'''Pyukumuku''' (Japanese: '''ナマコブシ''' ''Namakobushi'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

