==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pyukumuku}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Pyukumuku|47}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*{{a|Innards Out}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pyukumuku}} can have.
*'''Sprinkle Water''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Shellos|106}} from {{TCG|Secret Wonders}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

